      "text": "# iNucleus\n\niNucleus is an AI-native operating nucleus for knowledge systems, agent coordination, and IP evolution.\n\n## Brand Role\n\n- **Primary language**: English\n- **Track**: AI-native operations / knowledge systems / agent coordination\n- **Audience**: founders, agent builders, knowledge system teams\n- **Operating idea**: a compact core where knowledge, decisions, agents, and evolving IP assets stay aligned.\n\n## Voice\n\nPrecise, calm, systemic, and high-signal. Use fewer words than expected, but keep the architecture visible.\n\n## Visual Direction\n\nDark core, electric clarity, and minimal structural rhythm. Use deep ink surfaces, blue signal lines, and restrained violet accents.\n"
